WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Even after surgery

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,980
The remaining fees are enough for a while, so you can say I didn’t pay them. That’s not wrong.

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:12,500
Just now, a young man wearing a black down jacket came over to swipe the card.

4
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:17,580
It seems that the surname is Lin Yuyu

5
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,500
Didn’t dad look handsome when he gave him money just now?

6
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,730
Dad will give it to Yu Yu when he goes back

7
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:27,300
If I buy two sausages,

8
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,260
Since Yu Yu said so, buy it

9
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,300
Don’t just tell me to send money and stuff it in the basket later.

10
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,980
Otherwise, Aunt He would definitely not know about it.

11
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:40,880
How many times have you said this to Lao Lin along the way?
